{"t":"Suspected Vampire NPCs","s":"suspected-vampire-npcs-0273d","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Armenius_227748.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Suspected Vampire NPCs</b> are NPCs suspected to be a <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a> by the vampire hunters. According to <a href=\"#/wiki/Julius\">Julius</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a> is their leader. You will have to talk to all of them during the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Suspected Vampire NPCs (5 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\"><img alt=\"Armenius\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Armenius_227748.gif\" width=\"63\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Barkeeper</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">In a bar in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Trade%20Quarter\">Trade Quarter</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lisander\">Lisander</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lisander\"><img alt=\"Lisander\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lisander_3870e1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">The bar in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\">Maris</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\"><img alt=\"Maris\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Maris_d9d082.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ship Captain</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a> all the way north-west in the harbour. Also on <a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a> and on <a href=\"#/wiki/Mistrock\">Mistrock</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ortheus\">Ortheus</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ortheus\"><img alt=\"Ortheus\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ortheus_fe8cdb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Beggar</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a>, north-west section one floor up.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Serafin\">Serafin</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Serafin\"><img alt=\"Serafin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serafin_b0d0e2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Food%20Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Food Shopkeeper</a></td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Inner%20City\">Inner City</a>, near the entrance to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Quarter\">Sunken Quarter</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest"]}